      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>PrivateKeyWallet </b>- Unlock guest mode, an ephemeral generated wallet.

    <b>InAppWallet
    </b>- Ultimate onboarding through email, phone or social login.

    <b>EcosystemWallet
    </b>- Similar to In-App Wallets, and shareable with third parties.

    <b>External
    Wallets </b>- Onboard web3 native gamers with their preferred wallets.


    <b>Account
    Abstraction</b> - Turn <b>any</b> wallet into a Smart Wallet, allowing you to
    sponsor gas on behalf of users and unlocking advanced permission systems through
    what is known as session keys. Compliant with ERC-4337 on most EVM chains, and
    compatible with ZkSync native Account Abstraction.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
